  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A little space. A next step.",
    "overview": "ambi inherits its teal identity from the existing diagrams and expresses it as a quiet, light workspace. A restrained serif opening gives way to readable sans-serif conversation and task content. The interface keeps a thought, an explicit decision, and a reviewable draft visually distinct.\n\nThe first surface pairs conversation with a next-step notebook. Its desktop split and mobile stack support the current journey without making that exact composition mandatory for every future screen. The implementation direction used recorded roll `seed:7e8cc4d22c6b38fd`; this is provenance, not a user-selected option.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Teal actions on warm off-white and white surfaces.",
      "Serif invitation, sans-serif working content.",
      "Quiet borders and tonal separation.",
      "State communicated with text alongside color."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action Teal Rule",
        "body": "Use teal for the primary step and focus, keeping prose in ink and muted tones.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Working Voice Rule",
        "body": "Reserve serif typography for the invitation and notebook empty state; use sans-serif for decisions, drafts, controls, and conversation.",
